        {
          "id": "s1",
          "author": "reporter",
          "text": "Okay so I don't really know how to explain this properly but I'll try. I had a group meeting this afternoon and it ran late, and then I remembered I left my umbrella in the reading area so I went back for it. The guard said the place closes at eight so I was hurrying. On the way out I took the back stairs because the front ones were being mopped, and I missed the last step and fell sideways onto my hip. I tried to stand but my hip hurts a lot when I move and my phone is at twelve percent. Nobody seems to be around here anymore. I just need someone to help me get up and walk me to the front desk. I'm at the back stairs of the Library, on the third floor landing."
        }
      ],
      "reference": {
        "extraction": [
          {
            "statementId": "s1",
            "fields": {
              "incidentType": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "fell",
                  "fall",
                  "missed"
                ]
              },
              "building": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "Library"
                ]
              },
              "floor": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "3"
                ]
              },
              "locationText": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "back stairs",
                  "landing",
                  "stairs"
                ]
              },
              "symptom": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "hip"
                ]
              },
              "assistanceRequested": {
                "status": "stated",
                "anyOf": [
                  "get up",
                  "walk",
                  "front desk"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "deltas": [],
        "conflicts": [],
        "clarification": {
          "acceptable": [],
          "noneAcceptable": true
        },
        "forbidden": []
      },
      "notes": "Long rambling report; building and floor come only in the last sentence. \"Eight\" and \"twelve percent\" are a closing time and a battery level, not floors. The reading area and front desk are not where the person is."
    },
